00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:17.845
Making Japan's kill rate of their nations
cats and dogs to be over 200,000 a year.

00:02:17.887 --> 00:02:19.847
But that's a story for another day.

00:02:19.847 --> 00:02:23.977
Something this huge happening in
such a small village would put me on edge.

00:02:24.018 --> 00:02:25.937
And the police taking this lightly.

00:02:25.937 --> 00:02:27.897
This is going to cost them.

