00:07:50.344 --> 00:07:54.765
Okay, let's cool it on the scientific
mister smart guy terms for a sec.

00:07:54.765 --> 00:07:55.849
Now it would take a list.

00:07:55.849 --> 00:07:58.602
Site is simply a red blood cell
that is still developing.

